<Albert_Einstein> <base.kwebbase.kwtopic.has_sentences> "During the 1920s, a period when Germany's political situation was deteriorating rapidly and anti-Semitism was on the rise, he instead became involved in anti-nationalist and pacifist causes, and began publicly to support the Zionist movement - all of which made him highly unpopular with Germany's growing right wing." .
